    <worksheet name='Avg Stdzd Pymnt Across Highest and Lowest Cost States'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true'>Average Standardized Payment Across Different Groupings for The 3 Highest (PR, OK, UT) and 3 Lowest (MD, NJ, DE) Cost States</run>
            <run>

Average payment across the different groups remained relatively similar between the highest and lowest cost states except for the Community,Late grouping showing greater costs even more noticeably in the High comorbidity grouping for the highest cost states PR, OK, and UT.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
